{"id":"58e18722045b20e2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-proof-depth.md","title":"GL Proof Depth","display":"df-gl-proof-depth — GL Proof Depth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-proof-depth","aliases":["89-df-gl-proof-depth"],"display":"df-gl-proof-depth — GL Proof Depth","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-proof-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-proof-depth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-proof-depth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-proof-depth — GL Proof Depth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c61ecbdec24f26e8\" href=\"?note=c61ecbdec24f26e8\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-tree\">89-df-gl-proof-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=(N,r,\\chi,\\ell)\\in\\mathrm{PT}_{G\\!L}(A)\">\\(T=(N,r,\\chi,\\ell)\\in\\mathrm{PT}_{G\\!L}(A)\\)</span> (see\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c61ecbdec24f26e8\" href=\"?note=c61ecbdec24f26e8\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-tree\">89-df-gl-proof-tree</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}depth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Depth}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left\\{k\\in\\omega\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists p:k+1\\to N\\;\\Bigl(p(0)=r\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\exists j\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(p(i)))\\;\np(i+1)=\\chi(p(i))(j)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}depth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Depth}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left\\{k\\in\\omega\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists p:k+1\\to N\\;\\Bigl(p(0)=r\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\exists j\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(p(i)))\\;\np(i+1)=\\chi(p(i))(j)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL证明深度是证明树的最大深度</li>\n<li>候选集合含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，并因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 有限且树无环而有最大元。</li>\n<li>GL证明深度用于分析证明复杂度</li>\n<li>GL证明深度是模态逻辑的基本参数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"c61ecbdec24f26e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"c61ecbdec24f26e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$T=(N,r,\\chi,\\ell)\\in\\mathrm{PT}_{G\\!L}(A)$ (see\n[[89-df-gl-proof-tree]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"T=(N,r,\\chi,\\ell)\\in\\mathrm{PT}_{G\\!L}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}depth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Depth}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left\\{k\\in\\omega\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists p:k+1\\to N\\;\\Bigl(p(0)=r\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall i<k\\;\\exists j\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(p(i)))\\;\np(i+1)=\\chi(p(i))(j)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false}],"bytes":929,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-proof-depth]]"}],"outgoing":["c61ecbdec24f26e8"]}